          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.icarus.2007.04.020"
        },
        "falseColor": false,
        "notes": "Approximate triangular shape from published 20, 24 and 25 km equatorial sides and an 8 km polar semiaxis. Polar caps and the initial meridian are assumed; the original inversion mesh is unavailable. One mean color for the whole disc (Grav and Bauer 2007), scaled to an assumed 6% geometric albedo, an estimate; no terrain, albedo pattern or color variation is drawn."
